{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-prodentis-api-collection",
    "name": "PRODENTIS API",
    "description": "Colección REST para probar el backend PRODENTIS (Node.js + Express + PostgreSQL).\n\n**Requisitos:**\n1. PostgreSQL con base `prodentis`\n2. `cd backend && npm run dev` (puerto 3001)\n3. Variable `baseUrl` = `http://localhost:3001/api`\n\nLos requests de creación guardan IDs en variables de colección para reutilizarlos.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "patientId",
      "value": "p1"
    },
    {
      "key": "appointmentId",
      "value": "a1"
    },
    {
      "key": "inventoryId",
      "value": "i1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
